{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22842","headline":"蔷薇花一丛独死不知其故因有是篇 · 白居易","name":"蔷薇花一丛独死不知其故因有是篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柯条未尝损，根蕟不曾移。\n同类今齐茂，孤芳忽独萎。\n仍怜委地日，正是带花时。\n碎碧初凋叶，燋红尚恋枝。\n乾坤无厚薄，草木自荣衰。\n欲问因何事，春风亦不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}